        "text": "./add-skill drops a stranger's Markdown into an agent running with your keys. For months, no lock at the threshold. On 06-22 someone outside the project shipped one — PR #537, phylax-audit, a pre-install ALLOW/WARN/DENY gate. Not the maintainer. The ecosystem. The catch: it's opt-in, not wired into ./add-skill yet.",
